Description: NexusOS management agent (privileged helper)
 A small privileged helper for the Nexus Command Center and the nexus CLI.
 It is started on demand by systemd socket activation
 (/run/nexusos/agent.sock, group sudo), authorizes every request with polkit,
 performs only allow-listed operations (APT changes with progress and safe
 cancellation, repository management, gateway activation with nginx -t and
 rollback, certificate issuance, SMART and firewall status), audits each
 request and exits after two idle minutes.
 .
 The Command Center itself always runs as the logged-in user.
